317
00:17:25,309 --> 00:17:29,269
I've told you not to leave the palace on your own, but you don't listen to a word I say.

318
00:17:29,269 --> 00:17:33,889
If you can't take guards and you can't inform your staff, then you can't leave the palace and that's final.

319
00:17:33,889 --> 00:17:35,309
Shame on you, sir.

320
00:17:35,309 --> 00:17:36,309
Ja, Moon.

321
00:17:36,309 --> 00:17:37,889
It won't happen again.

322
00:17:37,889 --> 00:17:39,649
He got scolded?

323
00:17:39,649 --> 00:17:40,649
He got scolded?

324
00:17:40,649 --> 00:17:43,609
There are so many countless ways this could have gone wrong.

325
00:17:43,609 --> 00:17:46,569
Our kingdom is in a volatile political state right now.

326
00:17:46,569 --> 00:17:48,329
Surely as a king you realize that.

327
00:17:50,329 --> 00:17:52,329
Can we just have the banquet already?

328
00:17:52,329 --> 00:18:03,249
If you could stop scolding me, you'll notice that I brought back some very important people.

329
00:18:03,549 --> 00:18:05,809
They're the pirates who saved Megalo from the kraken.

330
00:18:06,049 --> 00:18:06,329
Huh?

331
00:18:06,709 --> 00:18:09,649
Let's welcome them properly so I can maintain my dignity.

332
00:18:10,509 --> 00:18:10,929
Hmm?

333
00:18:10,929 --> 00:18:12,469
Where is Shirohoshi?

334
00:18:12,469 --> 00:18:14,529
The princess should be here for this.

335
00:18:14,529 --> 00:18:17,729
Actually, your highness, we had another incident.

336
00:18:17,729 --> 00:18:24,949
And she found out?

337
00:18:25,109 --> 00:18:27,209
Don't give her another thing to worry about.

338
00:18:27,389 --> 00:18:28,929
She's a very delicate girl.

339
00:18:29,129 --> 00:18:30,069
You know that.

340
00:18:30,149 --> 00:18:31,549
Don't you give me that.

341
00:18:31,829 --> 00:18:37,809
If you don't want your daughter to worry, then how about you stay here in the palace where it's safe instead of running off unguarded?

342
00:18:37,949 --> 00:18:39,689
We thought you might be dead.

343
00:18:39,889 --> 00:18:41,129
It won't happen again.

344
00:18:41,369 --> 00:18:42,289
I promise.

345
00:18:43,529 --> 00:18:44,009
Wow.

346
00:18:44,229 --> 00:18:44,589
Again?

347
00:18:44,589 --> 00:18:49,089
It's a bit unfortunate that you brought the guest yourself.

348
00:18:49,289 --> 00:18:53,309
There was a development while you were out and a rather troubling one at that.

349
00:18:53,409 --> 00:18:53,809
Indeed.

350
00:18:54,369 --> 00:18:58,209
Prince Fukuboshi called and informed us of something better related and private.

351
00:18:58,629 --> 00:19:00,349
Oh my goodness, this is quite awkward.

352
00:19:00,449 --> 00:19:01,889
I trust our guests.

353
00:19:02,109 --> 00:19:03,129
Out with it already.

354
00:19:03,789 --> 00:19:05,229
That's the thing, sir.

355
00:19:06,749 --> 00:19:09,369
So, are we eating or?

356
00:19:09,649 --> 00:19:10,229
Hold on.

357
00:19:10,369 --> 00:19:11,309
Where'd Luffy go?

358
00:19:12,449 --> 00:19:14,529
He was here just a second ago.

359
00:19:14,749 --> 00:19:17,909
He couldn't stand still for five minutes if his life depended on it.

360
00:19:18,089 --> 00:19:19,349
This is the royal palace.

361
00:19:19,449 --> 00:19:21,409
You don't just wander around here on your own.

362
00:19:30,669 --> 00:19:33,789
I'm not here to watch some hairy fish dude get chewed out.

363
00:19:33,789 --> 00:19:34,749
But I'm here to eat.

364
00:19:34,749 --> 00:19:36,889
And I smell food this way.

365
00:19:38,389 --> 00:19:39,649
Getting closer.

366
00:19:39,649 --> 00:20:00,889
No water in here.

367
00:20:00,889 --> 00:20:01,629
That's weird.

368
00:20:01,629 --> 00:20:11,649
I can't smell anything now.

369
00:20:12,429 --> 00:20:14,549
The food must be through those giant doors.

370
00:20:14,549 --> 00:20:29,449
This place looks pretty fancy.

371
00:20:29,449 --> 00:20:30,909
It must be the banquet hall.

372
00:20:31,409 --> 00:20:33,869
Let's hope Zoro hasn't eaten all the good stuff.

373
00:20:33,869 --> 00:20:37,249
But man, kind of intimidating, isn't it?

374
00:20:37,549 --> 00:20:38,789
The doors are overkill.

375
00:20:39,789 --> 00:20:41,629
I feel like I'm backing Impel down.

376
00:20:42,049 --> 00:20:44,329
I really don't want people getting their food, huh?

377
00:20:44,989 --> 00:20:47,789
That must mean whatever they've got in there is super good!

378
00:20:47,789 --> 00:20:58,309
It's dark.

379
00:20:58,309 --> 00:20:59,349
Why is it dark?

380
00:21:02,389 --> 00:21:03,469
Well, who cares?

381
00:21:03,689 --> 00:21:05,109
The food smells great.

382
00:21:06,009 --> 00:21:07,829
Maybe it's going to be a surprise party.

383
00:21:08,069 --> 00:21:10,029
Either way, I think I've waited long enough.

384
00:21:10,449 --> 00:21:11,669
A little snack won't hurt.

385
00:21:11,669 --> 00:21:14,689
Wait, is this the table?

386
00:21:14,909 --> 00:21:15,929
Why is it squishy?

387
00:21:20,249 --> 00:21:22,469
What is this?

388
00:21:23,469 --> 00:21:26,709
Feels like some kind of coral, but why is it in a banquet hall?

389
00:21:30,509 --> 00:21:31,449
Squishy again.

390
00:21:31,729 --> 00:21:32,169
Weird.

391
00:21:35,809 --> 00:21:38,109
If someone's here, could you turn on the lights?

392
00:21:41,669 --> 00:21:44,929
Still really confused, but this sure is fun!

393
00:21:48,949 --> 00:21:50,509
Hello, who's there?

394
00:21:57,329 --> 00:21:59,689
What a horrid thing to do.

395
00:22:03,689 --> 00:22:06,809
Bouncing on a poor, helpless girl such as myself.

396
00:22:06,809 --> 00:22:12,729
Who are you, sir?

397
00:22:12,789 --> 00:22:14,009
And what are you doing here?

398
00:22:14,889 --> 00:22:16,249
Please don't hurt me.

399
00:22:20,689 --> 00:22:22,109
That's one big lady.

400
00:22:22,369 --> 00:22:23,889
I mean, big fish lady.

401
00:22:24,229 --> 00:22:25,669
Have you come to kill me too?

402
00:22:25,729 --> 00:22:26,929
Because I will have you now.

403
00:22:26,989 --> 00:22:27,829
I'm not afraid.

404
00:22:28,089 --> 00:22:29,209
No, not of you.

405
00:22:29,609 --> 00:22:30,929
Not of anyone else either.

406
00:22:31,409 --> 00:22:33,249
I am the daughter of King Neptune.

407
00:22:33,809 --> 00:22:34,469
I'm not...

408
00:22:34,469 --> 00:22:36,129
I'm not afraid of anything.

409
00:22:36,129 --> 00:22:37,849
Nothing at all.

410
00:22:45,549 --> 00:22:47,229
Someone help me!

411
00:22:47,589 --> 00:22:48,689
Brother, please!

412
00:22:49,069 --> 00:22:50,189
Brother, please!

413
00:22:51,049 --> 00:22:51,889
Hey, wait!

414
00:22:52,249 --> 00:22:53,849
We didn't come here to kill you, okay?

415
00:22:53,849 --> 00:22:53,969
Okay?

416
00:23:01,249 --> 00:23:02,609
You suck, lady!

417
00:23:03,269 --> 00:23:04,309
Shut up already!

418
00:23:06,129 --> 00:23:14,689
The Mermaid Princess Shirohoshi has been confined to the Hard Shell Tower for years.

419
00:23:14,689 --> 00:23:19,629
With its doors open for even a moment, Deccan launches an axe straight at her heart.

420
00:23:20,689 --> 00:23:26,709
Meanwhile, things take a sour turn for the Straw Hat Pirates in the palace as Neptune's army suddenly surrounds them.

421
00:23:26,709 --> 00:23:32,589
On the next, One Piece, a coward and a crybaby, the princess and the Hard Shell Tower.

422
00:23:32,929 --> 00:23:34,929
I'm gonna be King of the Pirates!

